    "mulaIast": "nanu evamavidyāyāṃ tannibandhanādhyāse na siddhe'pi na tasyāmanirvacanīyatvasiddhiḥ, lakṣaṇapramāṇayorabhāvāt | tathā hi- kimidamanirvācyatvam? (1) na tāvanniruktivirahaḥ, (2) tannimittajñānaviraho vā, (3) tannimittārthaviraho vā, (4) tannimittasāmānyaviraho vā | ādye anirvācya ityanenaiva niruktyā `idaṃ rūpya'miti niruktyā ca vyāghātāt | dvitīye niruktirūpaphalasattvena tannimittavirahasya vaktumaśakyatvāt | ata eva na tṛtīyaḥ, arthasya niruktāvanimittatvācca | phalasattvādeva na caturthaḥ | nāpi (5) sadvilakṣaṇatve satyasadvilakṣaṇatvam, sadasadrūpatve'pyupapatteḥ | ata eva (6)na sattvarāhitye satyasattvavirahaḥ, tathā ca lakṣaṇāsambhava iti- cenna, (1) sadvilakṣaṇatve sati asadvilakṣaṇatve sati sadasadvilakṣaṇatvam, (2) sattvāsattvābhyāṃ vicārāsahatve sati sadasattvena vicārāsahatvaṃ vā, (3) pratipannopādhau bādhyatvaṃ vā ityādilakṣaṇe niravadyatvasambhavāt | na ca ādye sato'pi sadantaravilakṣaṇatvāt siddhasādhanamiti- vācyam, sattvāvacchinnabhedasya sanneti pratītiprayojakasya sadvailakṣaṇyapadārthatvāt | na hi sati sadantarabhede'pi sanneti pratītiḥ, ato na siddhasādhanam | evaṃ ca sattvarahitatve sati asattvarahitatve sati sadasattvarahitatvamapi sādhu |\n\nsyādetat- sattvaṃ tāvat(1) sattājātirvā? arthakriyākāritvaṃ vā? (3) abādhyatvaṃ vā? (4) prāmāṇikatvaṃ vā? (5) aśūnyatvaṃ vā? (6) brahmatvaṃ vā? (7) parāṅgīkṛtaṃ vā? nādyadvitīyau, śuddhātmani sadvailakṣaṇyasya prapañce sadvailakṣaṇyābhāvasya cāpātāt | na tṛtīyaḥ, tvanmate tucchasyāpyabādhyatvena tatra sadvailakṣaṇyasyānirvācyatvasya bādhyatvenāsadvailakṣaṇyasya cāyogāt | na caturthaḥ, pramā hyantaḥkaraṇavṛttiḥ, tadviṣayatvasya prapañce'pi sattvena sadvailakṣaṇyasya tatrāsattvaprasaṅgāt | na pañcamaḥ, tasya prapañce'pi vidyamānatvena tadvailakṣaṇyābhāvaprasaṅgāt | na ṣaṣṭhaḥ, tadvailakṣaṇyasya jagati sattveneṣṭāpatteḥ | na saptamaḥ, parābhyupagatasya sattvasyāsattvaviraharūpatvena ubhayavailakṣaṇyoktyayogāt | ata eva- eteṣāṃ virahasyāsattvarūpatvaṃ- nirastam | athāsattvaṃ nirupākhyatvam? niḥsvarūpatvaṃ vā? nādyaḥ, asadādipadenaiva khyāyamānatvāt, na dvitīyaḥ svarūpeṇa niṣedhapakṣe śuktirūpyāderapi niḥsvarūpatvenāsadvailakṣaṇyānupapatteriti- cenna, parābhimatasattvāsattve eva vivakṣite, na tu pāribhāṣike ato na tādṛksadasadvailakṣaṇyoktāviṣṭāpattiḥ nāpi- tayoḥ parasparaviruddhatvena ekaniṣedhasyāparavidhiparyavasannatayā ekatrobhayavailakṣaṇyaṃ vyāhatamiti- vācyam, niṣedhasamuccayasyātāttvikatvāṅgīkārāt na vyāhatiḥ, na hyatāttvikarajatena śuktervirodhaḥ | na ca tarhi sadādivailakṣaṇyoktiḥ katham? tattatpratiyogidurnirūpatāmātraprakaṭanāya | na hi svarūpato durnirūpasya kiñcidapi rūpaṃ vāstavaṃ sambhavati |\n\nnanu- sattvādirāhityasyātāttvikatve'pi sattvāderdurnirūpatvamātreṇānirvācyatve pañcamaprakārāvidyānivṛttau `nānirvācyo'pi tatkṣaya' iti anirvācyatvaniṣedhāyogaḥ, sattvādivattadrāhityasyāpyatāttvikatve sattvādau pramāṇanirāsena tadrāhitye taduktyayogaḥ | avirodhāya vidhisamuccayasyaivātāttvikatvasvīkāraśceti- cenna, pañcamaprakārāvidyānivṛttipakṣe naitattratayavilakṣaṇatvamātramanirvācyatvam, kintu muktikālānavasthāyitvasahitam | tathā ca muktikālāvasthāyinyāmavidyānivṛttau anirvācyatvaniṣedho yujyate | sattvādirāhitye tu abādhitārthaviṣayakapramāṇoktirnāstyeva | jñāpakamātroktistadaṃśe'sādhāraṇī | ato vādivipratipattinirāsārthā | atāttvikavidhisamuccayāpattistviṣṭaiva | na hyatāttvikasattvāsattve niṣedhasamuccaye'pi virudhyete | yattu vidhisamuccayasyātāttvikatvapakṣe bhrāntibādhavyavasthā na syādityuktam, tanna, atāttvikatvādeva bhrānterbādhasya sattvapratiṣedhasyāpratikṣepāt sattvasyātāttvikatvācca tadupapatteḥ |\n\nnanu- niṣedhasamuccayasyātāttvikatvaṃ kimubhayātāttvikatvādvā? ekaikātāttvikatvādvā? nādyaḥ, ubhayatāttvikatvavadubhayātāttvikatvasyāpi viruddhatvāt, vidhisamuccayasya tāttvikatvāpātācca | ekaikapratiyogitāttvikatvāpattereva na dvitīyo'pi, tāttvikātyantābhāvapratiyogina eva atāttvikatvāditi- cenna, ubhayātāttvikatvādeva niṣedhasamuccayasyātāttvikatvam | na cobhayatāttvikatvavadubhayātāttvikatvamapyekatra viruddham, valmīkādāvekatra sthāṇutvapuruṣatvayoratāttvikatvadarśanāt | na ca paraspara viraharūpayorekatrobhayoratāttvikatvaṃ viruddham, ekatra tantvādau ghaṭatatprāgabhāvayorubhayorapi atāttvikatvadarśanāt | na ca pratiyogitadatyantābhāvayorevāyaṃ niyamaḥ, niyāmakābhāvādasmākamasampratipatteḥ | vastutastu- sattvāsattvayorna parasparaviraharūpatvam, kintu parasparavirahavyāpyatāmātram | na ca- tādṛśapāribhāṣikasadasadvailakṣaṇyoktau nāsmākamaniṣṭam iti- vācyam, sattvamabādhyatvam, asattvaṃ sattvena pratītyanarhatvam, tadubhayavailakṣaṇyaṃ ca tava jagatyasampratipannamiti kathamiṣṭāpattyavakāśaḥ? iṣṭāpattau ca kathaṃ na matakṣatiḥ? ata eva dhvaṃsānupalakṣitatadupalakṣitasattāyogitvarūpanityatvānityatvayoḥ sattāhīne sāmānyādāvabhāvavaduttarāvadhirāhityaṃ nityatvaṃ, bhāvānyanivṛttimattvaṃ cānityatvam, tadubhayābhāvaḥ prāgabhāva iva kvacidrūpyādau mithyābhūte sattvāsattvayorabhāvaḥ | syādityāhuḥ, uktasattvāsattvayoḥ parasparavirahavyāpyatve'pi parasparavirahānātmakatvāt | uktanityatvānityatvavat |"
